09:22:56 said  The singleplayer skirmish and battle modes are still there, with all original terrain, icons, cursors and sounds kept in the same project folder.
09:22:56 said  Godot can no longer hang in tests: every test mode has a wall-clock watchdog, the fast headless match runs a few hundred ticks per frame instead of blocking, and screenshots work headless with a map render fallback so a blank picture is never saved.
