09:40:03 said  Rebuilt the map and look to match the original much closer: open plains with forest belts, hills, lakes with sand shores, dirt roads, farm field rectangles, and clustered trees, rocks and mines.
09:40:03 said  Buildings are now top-down RTS shapes with dirt ground plates, walls, roofs and player trim instead of big UI icons, and terrain uses the original grass and dirt detail per tile. All tests still pass with no hangs, including fast command-line testing and cross-platform rendering.
