09:49:01 said  Built a single-player skirmish port that runs from one folder on Windows, Linux and macOS.
09:49:01 said  Tests all pass with no hangs: normal play runs 120 frames clean, scripted self-test passes all 7 steps, fast command-line match finishes in seconds, and screenshots are never blank. I also extracted what is readable from the closed map files into mission summaries, and converted all 29 original unit and building meshes for private use.
09:49:01 said  Still estimated: the exact original terrain grid stays closed with no public spec, the full 3D look needs Blender rendering, and enemy behavior is an approximation. A good next step would be to pick one original mission for me to mimic more closely.
